Now the only difference here is you want
to number where the double bond starts,

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:32.300
which is on carbon number 2 in this case.

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:37.689
I would say two, three,
dichloro, two, ene, right?

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:40.410
And notice how it's not
always sister trans.

